| graph_04_credibility_curve.png | Credibility Z plotted against combined exposure with theoretical curve |

## Honest limitations
The data is synthetic — I generated it to demonstrate the 
methodology rather than to produce real market rates. In a 
production environment you would replace the synthetic data with 
actual policy, claims and exposure extracts. The nationality 
relativities and development patterns are based on publicly 
available UAE market information and would need calibrating against 
real portfolio experience.

